   "name": "Leave Type-custom_info",
   "no_copy": 0,
   "non_negative": 0,
   "options": "<hr>\n<div class=\"p-3\">\n    <h4>{%= __(\"Quick Help for Setting Leave Allocation Based On Attendance\") %}:</h4>\n    <p>To enable Leave Allocation based on attendance, firstly enable the <b>\"Enable Leave Allocation Based On Attendance\"</b> checkbox.</p>\n    <ol>\n        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n            {%= __(\"Enable Leave Allocation Based On Attendance\") %}\n            <ul>\n                <li>After enabling the checkbox, you will see required fields to set up:</li>\n                <ol>\n                    <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n                        <b>{%= __(\"Attendance Count Based On Attendance\") %}</b>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>In Attendance Count Based On, \"Leaves\" and \"Attendance\" are selected by default.</li>\n                            <li>If \"Selected <b>Leaves and Attendance</b>\" is chosen, Attendance will be counted with the following criteria:</li>\n                            <ul style=\"list-style-type: decimal\">\n                                <li>Full Day</li>\n                                <li>Work From Home</li>\n                                <li>Half Day</li>\n                                <li>Holidays</li>\n                                <li>Weekly Off Days</li>\n                                <li><u>Leave Type Attendance from the Type Of Leaves field</u> located below the <u>Attendance count based on</u></li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <li>If \"Selected <b>Attendance</b>\" is chosen, Attendance will count with the following criteria:</li>\n                            <ul style=\"list-style-type: decimal\">\n                                <li>Full Day Count</li>\n                                <li>Work From Home</li>\n                                <li>Half Day</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </ul>\n                    </li>\n                    <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><b>Type of Leaves</b></li>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">This field will be mandatory if <b>\"Leaves and Attendance\"</b> are selected in Attendance Count Based On.</li>\n                        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">This Field is a Multiselect Field, allowing the selection of multiple leaves. Attendance records will be counted based on the leave types selected in this field.</li>\n                        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">This field will not be visible if <b>\"Attendance\"</b> is selected in Attendance Count Based On.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><b>Minimum Required Days</b></li>\n                </ol>\n            </ul>\n        </li>\n    </ol>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n    th,\n    td {\n        padding: 10px;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<body>\n    <b>How the Monthly required days will count</b>\n    <table border=\"1\">\n        <tr>\n            <th align=\"center\">Earned Leave Frequency</th>\n            <th align=\"center\">Formula to count Minimum Days Required</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Monthly</td>\n            <td>(minimum required days) * 1</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Quarterly</td>\n            <td>(minimum required days) * 3</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Half-Year</td>\n            <td>(minimum required days) * 6</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Yearly</td>\n            <td>(minimum required days) * 12</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n",
   "owner": "Administrator",
